<title>USA: Transport Corp CEO Aronson named chairman.</title>
<headline>Transport Corp CEO Aronson named chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport Corp of America Inc said chief executive James Aronson was named to the added post of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Robert Meyers was elected president and chief operating officer, replacing Aronson, the trucking company said.</p>
<p>Meyers has been executive vice president of Transport America since 1994, chief financial officer since 1993, and chief information officer since 1992, it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
